# ____title____
#
# A short film. `pnpm build` says it and films the page in index.html, which draws
# every picture itself. The script tells it which scene it is:
#
#   [slide lamp]          the scene the page calls `lamp`
#   [slide boat step:2]   a second beat of a scene, for the page to use as it likes
#
@characters
NARRATOR: { persona: narrator, name: ____fullName____, title: ____role____ }
---
[speakers captions]
[slide dusk]
NARRATOR: At dusk the keeper climbs the stairs.
[slide lamp]
NARRATOR: The lamp is lit, and the light goes round.
[slide boat]
NARRATOR: Somewhere out there, a boat sees it.
[slide boat step:1]
NARRATOR: And turns for home.
[pause 0.5]
[slide dawn]
NARRATOR: By morning the lamp is out, and everybody is in.
